{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日はみなみとレコメン！ゲスト出演したよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2016/10/19/4710252/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったね(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のりさんのおかげでリラックスして臨めました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レコメンの前には"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日マネージャーを卒業したまゆこと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"焼肉行ってきたんだー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2016/10/19/4710252/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くっちゃべった〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まゆこは特に絡みに行ってた相手だから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会うといっぱい喋っちゃう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日一緒じゃないのは寂しいけれど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お互いやりたい事に向かって頑張るのだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また会いましょー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてやっぱりお肉って幸せ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2016/10/19/4710252/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかりにくいけどこれ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お肉のお寿司みたいになってるの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おしゃれ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","